      "contextBefore": "In the example below, [`tryFilter(_:)`](publisher/tryfilter(_:).md) checks to see if the element provided by the publisher is zero, and throws a `ZeroError` before terminating the publisher with the thrown error.",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nstruct ZeroError: Error {}\n\nlet numbers: [Int] = [1, 2, 3, 4, 0, 5]\ncancellable = numbers.publisher\n    .tryFilter{\n        if $0 == 0 {\n            throw ZeroError()\n        } else {\n            return $0 % 2 == 0\n        }\n    }\n    .sink(\n        receiveCompletion: { print (\"\\($0)\") },\n        receiveValue: { print (\"\\($0)\", terminator: \" \") }\n     )\n\n// Prints: \"2 4 failure(DivisionByZeroError())\".\n```",
